      "writtenOn": "2021-05-28T01:08:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "this seems to be broken now (at least compared to the old behavior). You update last_successful_next if this is true, but you don\u0027t read it, so any log lines already skipped are lost.",
      "revId": "1390f05d367ec1e5360690d66cd368bb0f708528",
