      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-06-02T01:35:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, the flag that trusty_get_panic_status returns can change while dumping the logs as it is not protected by the log lock.",
      "parentUuid": "a5fe30c9_75119893",
      "revId": "1390f05d367ec1e5360690d66cd368bb0f708528",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
